# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID for browser sign-in (@react-oauth/google).
# Get it from https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# This is the *Client ID* (ends in .apps.googleusercontent.com), NOT the client secret.
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your value. `.env` is gitignored.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
